      "id": 1,
      "text": "Plattsburg began as Concord, briefly became Springfield, and finally took its current name from Plattsburgh, New York, honoring settlers' hometowns.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
